      "side": 1,
      "message": "This part is analogous to `GetTextureViewDescriptorWithDefaults` here: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/Texture.cpp;drc\u003db8271edbc28fc426d4af05f5878c00c11bc6020f;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1;l\u003d899\n\nSo let\u0027s move that out. We should also be calling it before we even call `ValidateTexelBufferViewDescriptor` so that we don\u0027t have to duplicate the size defaulting logic.\n\nSo what I\u0027m imagining:\n```\nTexelBufferViewDescriptor desc \u003d GetTexelViewDescriptorWithDefaults(descOrig);\n\nUnpackedPtr\u003cTexelBufferViewDescriptor\u003e unpacked;\nif (device-\u003eIsValidationEnabled()) {\n        DAWN_TRY_ASSIGN_CONTEXT(\n            unpacked,\n            ValidateTexelBufferViewDescriptor(this, descriptor),\n            \"validating %s\", descriptor\n        );\n} else {\n    unpacked \u003d Unpack(\u0026desc);\n}\n```",
